<rml>
<head>
<title>Список обмена</title>
<link type="text/rcss" href="../kit.rcss"/>
</head>
<body class="gallery">
<div class="g-page">
<div class="g-title">C-TradeList</div>
<div class="g-note">На всю ширину экрана: числовые колонки сохраняют ширину, растёт колонка имени</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 100%; height: 300dp; padding: 0"><c-trade-list id="tl-wide" label="Товар"
    cols='[{"label":"В трюме"},{"label":"В магазине"},{"label":"Цена"}]'
    rows='[{"name":"Ядра","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"ammo","enamel":"parchment"},"meta":"экспорт · пачка 20","metaTone":"ok","cells":["200","1840",{"text":"5","bold":true,"sub":"продажа 3"}],"selected":true,"q":{"value":300,"max":2040,"unit":"шт.","summary":"+100 · −500"}},
           {"name":"Лечебное зелье","image":{"kind":"item","texture":"INTERFACES/items19","cell":1,"icon":"potion"},"meta":"снадобье","cells":["3","12",{"text":"120","bold":true,"sub":"продажа 60"}]},
           {"name":"Бомбы","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"bomb","enamel":"parchment"},"cells":["0","0",{"text":"14","bold":true}],"disabled":true,"reason":"нечего продать"},
           {"name":"Ром","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"rum","enamel":"parchment"},"meta":"контрабанда","metaTone":"danger","cells":["60","12500",{"text":"12","bold":true,"tone":"gold"}]}]'/></div>
</div>
<div class="g-note">Магазин: выбранная строка раскрыта в C-Quantity; жетон товара, игровая картинка предмета, недоступная (disabled + reason — тостом), нули как «—»</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 700dp; height: 300dp; padding: 0"><c-trade-list id="tl-store" label="Товар"
    cols='[{"label":"В трюме"},{"label":"В магазине"},{"label":"Цена"}]'
    rows='[{"name":"Ядра","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"ammo","enamel":"parchment"},"meta":"экспорт · пачка 20","metaTone":"ok","cells":["200","1840",{"text":"5","bold":true,"sub":"продажа 3"}],"selected":true,"q":{"value":300,"max":2040,"unit":"шт.","summary":"+100 · −500"}},
           {"name":"Лечебное зелье","image":{"kind":"item","texture":"INTERFACES/items19","cell":1,"icon":"potion"},"meta":"снадобье","cells":["3","12",{"text":"120","bold":true,"sub":"продажа 60"}]},
           {"name":"Бомбы","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"bomb","enamel":"parchment"},"cells":["0","0",{"text":"14","bold":true}],"disabled":true,"reason":"нечего продать"},
           {"name":"Ром","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"rum","enamel":"parchment"},"meta":"контрабанда","metaTone":"danger","cells":["60","12500",{"text":"12","bold":true,"tone":"gold"}]}]'/></div>
</div>
<div class="g-note">dense + dock: список не двигается, открытая строка — в доке справа (объект, текст, количество столбиком); чипы-фильтры в шапке, сортировка по заголовку, быстрое «взять всё» в конце строки; содержимое компонента — внизу дока</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 100%; height: 300dp; padding: 0"><c-trade-list id="tl-dock" dense="1" dock="1" quick="hand" label="Товар"
    filters='[{"label":"Все","selected":true},{"label":"Мои"},{"label":"Здесь"},{"label":"Недоступно","disabled":true}]'
    cols='[{"label":"У вас","icon":"capacity","sortable":true},{"label":"Здесь","icon":"store","sortable":true,"sort":"desc"}]'
    rows='[{"name":"Лечебное зелье","image":{"kind":"item","texture":"INTERFACES/items19","cell":1,"icon":"potion"},"meta":"снадобье","sub":"снадобье · вес 0,2","text":"Восстанавливает 40 единиц жизни.","facts":[{"icon":"price-buy","iconTone":"green","v":"150","tone":"gold"},{"icon":"price-sell","iconTone":"danger","v":"75","tone":"gold"},{"icon":"weight","v":"0.2"}],"cells":["3","2"],"quick":true,"selected":true,"q":{"value":3,"max":5,"zones":true,"origin":3,"lessLabel":"Отдать","moreLabel":"Взять","label":"У вас","steps":[1,10],"summary":"-"}},
           {"name":"Ядра","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"ammo","enamel":"parchment"},"meta":"экспорт","metaTone":"ok","cells":["200","1840"],"quick":true},
           {"name":"Бомбы","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"bomb","enamel":"parchment"},"cells":["14","0"]}]'><div style="flex: 1 1 0"></div><c-button id="tl-dock-all" variant="primary" label="Взять всё" style="width: 100%"/></c-trade-list></div>
</div>
<div class="g-note">Обмен с кораблём / наём: image: портрет, голый значок, жетон, предмет; тона ячеек, отрицательные числа и тысячи</div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 520dp; height: 232dp; padding: 0"><c-trade-list id="tl-swap" label="Груз"
    cols='[{"label":"Моё"},{"label":"Их"},{"label":"Разница"}]'
    rows='[{"name":"Тичингиту","image":{"kind":"portrait","texture":"INTERFACES/PORTRAITS/128/face_205"},"meta":"абордажник · жалованье 120","cells":["1","0",{"text":-120,"tone":"danger"}]},
           {"name":"Доски","image":{"kind":"icon","icon":"planks"},"meta":"ремонт корпуса","metaTone":"gold","cells":[1200,"340",{"text":"860","tone":"ok"}],"selected":true},
           {"name":"Парусина","image":{"kind":"icon","icon":"sailcloth"},"cells":["","—",{"text":"0"}],"disabled":true,"reason":"нечего продать"},
           {"name":"Дублоны","image":{"kind":"item","texture":"INTERFACES/items6","cell":3,"icon":"money"},"cells":[{"text":"25000","bold":true},{"text":"12 шт.","tone":"dim"},{"text":"1250000","tone":"gold","sub":"по курсу"}]}]'/></div>
  <div class="g-wood" style="width: 330dp; height: 232dp; padding: 0"><c-trade-list id="tl-short" label="Команда" cols='[{"label":"Нанять"}]'
    rows='[{"name":"Матросы","cells":[{"text":"40","bold":true,"sub":"по 15"}]},
           {"name":"Очень длинное название товара, которое не помещается","image":{"kind":"token","icon":"hero","enamel":"teal"},"meta":"и очень длинная вторая строка тоже обрезается","cells":["7"]}]'/></div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
